text There was someone who's longed for it with all their heart...
text @[Tomoya]
text For today to happen...
text @[Tomoya]
text She tried her hardest...
text @[Tomoya]
text All alone...
text @[Tomoya]
text To gather so many blessings...
text @[Tomoya]
text She was always by my side...
text @[Tomoya]
text And I...
text @[Tomoya]
text I worked so hard together with her...
text Yet, the only thing I can remember is the lingering warmth.
text @[Tomoya]
text I feel like we've worked really hard forever...
text Maybe there were lots of other things.
text Maybe we've made a lot of memories together.
text @[Tomoya]
