text It's break time again.
text As always, I'm burying my face on the desk.
sound 54R.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Is she a student of this school?
text A pair sitting in front of me are striking up a conversation.
sound 54S.aac
text @[Boy B]
text Yep.
sound 54T.aac
text @[Boy B]
text She got into an accident two years ago, and has been in a coma ever since.
sound 54U.aac
text @[Boy C]
text Ah, that. I know that story.
text Another student joins in.
sound 54V.aac
text @[Boy C]
text From what I heard, she's the younger sister of an ex-teacher of our school.
sound 54W.aac
text @[Boy A]
text What's the teacher's name?
sound 54X.aac
text @[Boy C]
text Ibuki.
sound 54Y.aac
text @[Boy C]
text An art teacher, I heard.
sound 54Z.aac
text @[Boy A]
text A female teacher?
sound 550.aac
text @[Boy C]
text Yep. But she quit three years ago, so no one knows about her.
sound 551.aac
text @[Boy A]
text And...?
sound 552.aac
text @[Boy C]
text And what?
sound 553.aac
text @[Boy A]
text I'm asking if she's hot.
sound 554.aac
text @[Boy C]
text I already said no one knew about her!
sound 555.aac
text @[Boy C]
text But the rumor says she's quite a beauty.
sound 556.aac
