text So that's how it is... The little sister should also be a beauty, and that's why everyone's hyped about her.
sound 557.aac
text @[Boy A]
text The sleeping beauty phenomenon.
sound 558.aac
text @[Boy B]
text Well, I heard she's more "cute" than "hot."
sound 559.aac
text @[Boy A]
text Who said that?
sound 55A.aac
text @[Boy B]
text The rumor.
sound 55B.aac
